==Battleground==
*2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Zackie Peng]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.
**4 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**4 [[Star Peng]]s spawn, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
**2 [[Star Peng]]s spawn, delay 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
**4 [[Hermit Peng]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Because of the fact that every enemy here besides Hermit Peng has Single Attack, plenty of meatshields are more than necessary. As long as you bring good attackers such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], this stage shouldn't be a problem. However, the Star Pengs can be a bit tough without [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] so it is recommended that you get at least a few of them before attempting this stage.

